  "description": "In an age when everyone draws upon the power of Constellations, there is but one man who believes in the sword. In a world where skills have become the measure of strength, one man reached the pinnacle with nothing but his sword— The Last Swordmaster, Limón Asphelder. Even if the world has forgotten him, his sword has yet to reach its end.\n\n*\"Skills? I don’t need them. All I need is my sword.\"*\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
